            <ArticleTitle>Studies on the structure-activity relationship of bicifadine analogs as monoamine transporter inhibitors.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3682-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bmcl.2008.05.077</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Compounds with various activities and selectivities were discovered through structure-activity relationship studies of bicifadine analogs as monoamine transporter inhibitors. The norepinephrine-selective 2-thienyl compound S-6j was efficacious in a rodent pain model.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
